      <title>Peapack Private Appoints Ana Parra as Senior Managing Director, Group Director</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>BEDMINSTER, N.J., Oct.  05, 2026  (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- </p> <p>Peapack-Gladstone Financial Corporation (NASDAQ Global Select Market: PGC) and Peapack Private Bank &amp; Trust are pleased to announce the appointment of Ana Parra as Senior Managing Director, Group Director.  Based in the Bank’s Park Avenue office in Manhattan, she will focus on serving the complex financial needs of high-net-worth individuals, families, family offices, and privately held businesses while leading a team dedicated to delivering customized private banking solutions.</p>]]></description>
